    {
      "q": "Which school district covers Burnaby?",
      "a": "Public schools with a Burnaby address are run by School District 41 (Burnaby)."
    },
    {
      "q": "How do I find the catchment school for a Burnaby address?",
      "a": "Ask School District 41 (Burnaby) to confirm it for the exact street address."
